    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:22px;font-size:16px;color:rgba(243,241,236,0.62);max-width:54ch;">The Artist Growth Intensive is a personalized strategy experience for artists who want to understand exactly what's working, what's holding them back and what they should do next.</p>

